{"id":"666165","name":"葱油饼(葱肉饼)","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/666165/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"特筋面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"4克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"2克"},{"name":"无铝泡打粉","amount":"2克(可不加)"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"15克"},{"name":"温水(50度左右)","amount":"350克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"8克"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1克"},{"name":"盐(用海盐也可)","amount":"1.5克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"5克"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"特精面粉500克，加入3克酵母，盐4克，糖2克，无铝泡打粉2克猪油15克。","img":"images/666165/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入350克温水(50度左右)或380克温牛奶。","img":"images/666165/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀，是比较稀的面团。","img":"images/666165/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，醒发至两倍大(2个小时以上，中间提取面团折叠几次。","img":"images/666165/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克猪肉剁成末，加1.5克盐。","img":"images/666165/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加8克姜末，1克胡椒粉，鸡精5克，3克花椒粉，最后加入150～200克的葱花。","img":"images/666165/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666165/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面团发好了。","img":"images/666165/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揪一块面团(80克左右)。","img":"images/666165/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/666165/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/666165/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"起锅烧油，下入面剂子，按扁，稍大的圆面饼。","img":"images/666165/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/666165/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/666165/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"外焦里嫩，蕉香酥脆。","img":"images/666165/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}